來像是點綴，沒有辦法作為主食，口感是以鹹甜鹹甜為主的，如果想要專攻叉燒香氣的話，這不會是一個很好的選擇😊\n\n裏面有冰水跟冰紅茶，還有提供一些佐料，如蒜酥、七味粉等等的，還有能綁頭髮的髮圈。",null,[0,26]]]],[null,1756821008000000,1756821008000000,"1 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfOFZKUUNBTm5hQUhWbEVWdTJGMXI5QQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfOFZKUUNBTm5hQUhWbEVWdTJGMXI5QRoTQ2d3SWtPemJ4UVlRN2ZEdS1nRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwid1Mie9tmWAxWUsVYBHZBFKb8Q_2MI3gEoDQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7738281815642049098/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4V0ZSWVZrOVdWemxTVm10ak5WTnJVbWxqVjFKTFVqSTVUMkZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7738281815642049098/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4V0ZSWVZrOVdWemxTVm10ak5WTnJVbWxqVjFKTFVqSTVUMkZyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7738281815642049098/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4V0ZSWVZrOVdWemxTVm10ak5WTnJVbWxqVjFKTFVqSTVUMkZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7738281815642049098/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4V0ZSWVZrOVdWemxTVm10ak5WTnJVbWxqVjFKTFVqSTVUMkZyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7738281815642049098/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4V0ZSWVZrOVdWemxTVm10ak5WTnJVbWxqVjFKTFVqSTVUMkZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7738281815642049098/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4V0ZSWVZrOVdWemxTVm10ak5WTnJVbWxqVjFKTFVqSTVUMkZyUlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝您給予初原的好評支持\n有您的鼓勵會讓我們更有動力\n\n也歡迎追蹤點讚我們初原的FB和IG唷",null,[0,26]]]],[null,null,4607,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xWFRYVk9WVzlSVmtjNVNrUmljV1JLUjI5T2FrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xf273453a869bba0d!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm1XTXVOVW9RVkc5SkRicWRKR29OakE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/r